    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a number cannot be FALSE; Article 2(2): "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (seam S14, fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
         ELSE IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the AI system is a high-risk AI system` `the route to high-risk`)
              THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the provision speaks of high-risk AI systems
              ELSE JUST 15

-- Paragraph 3: "Notwithstanding paragraph 2 ... in the event of a widespread infringement or a serious incident as defined in Article 3, point (49)(b)": two days.
-- src:1133 | 3. Notwithstanding paragraph 2 of this Article, in the event of a widespread infringement or a serious incident as defined in Article 3, point (49)(b), the report referred to in paragraph 1 of this Article shall be provided immediately, and not later than two days after the provider or, where applicable, the deployer becomes aware of that incident.
