-- The helper that picks the days a paragraph gives, or the fallback when it gives none (a plain function, no provision).
GIVEN `the days a paragraph gives` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the fallback` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 73(2) to (4) the days that the paragraph gives or else the fallback` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the days a paragraph gives`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the fallback`
    WHEN JUST `the days` THEN `the days`

-- Paragraphs 3 and 4 both say "Notwithstanding paragraph 2". A death that is also a critical-infrastructure incident or a widespread
-- infringement meets both ceilings ("not later than"), so the shorter binds (fork F-73-3-4-both).
