    IF `Arts 72 to 79 Article 2(2) cuts off the provision` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 73 2
