              ELSE IF NOT `the serious incident has been reported pursuant to paragraph 1`
                   THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is "Following the reporting of a serious incident pursuant to paragraph 1"
                   ELSE JUST (`the provider has performed the necessary investigations in relation to the serious incident and the AI system concerned without delay` AND `the investigations include a risk assessment of the incident` AND `the investigations include corrective action`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the provider shall, without delay, perform the necessary investigations ... This shall include a risk assessment of the incident, and corrective action" (a bare "shall" not done, taken case by case)

-- src:1137 | The provider shall cooperate with the competent authorities, and where relevant with the notified body concerned, during the investigations referred to in the first subparagraph, and shall not perform any investigation which involves altering the AI system concerned in a way which may affect any subsequent evaluation of the causes of the incident, prior to informing the competent authorities of such action.
