      `the notified body concerned is relevant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provider cooperates with the notified body concerned during the investigations` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 73(6) second subparagraph the provider has met the duty to cooperate with the competent authorities and, where relevant, the notified body concerned` MEANS
    IF `Arts 72 to 79 Article 2(2) cuts off the provision` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 73 6
    THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): Article 2(2): "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (seam S14, fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies to the AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives, and Art 111(2) saves a high-risk AI system placed earlier and not significantly changed
         ELSE IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the AI system is a high-risk AI system` `the route to high-risk`)
