GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 73 act`
`Art 73(7) the Commission's duty to develop and issue dedicated guidance` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 73(7) the date by which the Commission must issue dedicated guidance on the obligations set out in paragraph 1` `the date asked`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed on the date asked: the group General does not yet apply
    WHEN JUST `the deadline` THEN
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission`
        MUST `Art 73(7) develop and issue dedicated guidance to facilitate compliance with the obligations set out in paragraph 1`
        WITHIN (Day `the deadline`) MINUS (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission` BECAUSE "the dedicated guidance was not issued by 2 August 2025"

-- src:1138 | 7. Upon receiving a notification related to a serious incident referred to in Article 3, point (49)(c), the relevant market surveillance authority shall inform the national public authorities or bodies referred to in Article 77(1). The Commission shall develop dedicated guidance to facilitate compliance with the obligations set out in paragraph 1 of this Article. That guidance shall be issued by 2 August 2025, and shall be assessed regularly.
@ref Art 73(7) third sentence (src:1138)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 73 act`
`Art 73(7) the Commission's duty to assess the guidance regularly` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party Commission`
        MUST `Art 73(7) assess the guidance regularly`
        HENCE FULFILLED

§ `Article 73(8): the market surveillance authority acts within seven days`

-- src:1139 | 8. The market surveillance authority shall take appropriate measures, as provided for in Article 19 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, within seven days from the date it received the notification referred to in paragraph 1 of this Article, and shall follow the notification procedures as provided in that Regulation.
@ref Art 73(8) (src:1139)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the date the market surveillance authority received the notification referred to in paragraph 1` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Art 73(8) the date by which the market surveillance authority must take appropriate measures` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE JUST (`the date the market surveillance authority received the notification referred to in paragraph 1` PLUS 7)  -- "within seven days from the date it received the notification"

-- src:1139 | 8. The market surveillance authority shall take appropriate measures, as provided for in Article 19 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, within seven days from the date it received the notification referred to in paragraph 1 of this Article, and shall follow the notification procedures as provided in that Regulation.
@ref Art 73(8) (src:1139)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 73 act`
`Art 73(8) the market surveillance authority's duty to take appropriate measures within seven days` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority`
        MUST `Art 73(8) take appropriate measures as provided for in Article 19 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020`
        WITHIN 7
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority` BECAUSE "appropriate measures were not taken within seven days from the date the notification was received"

